Z||000008||1FST2M6||12-28-2000||10:19 AM||||there is a capacitor on the MAT sensor at the ECU.. if you take that off it will probly run better.. it's lying to the computer tell it it's colder for more fuel!  (some of Eds magic wand handy work)<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig1fst.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by 1FST2M6 (edited 12-28-2000).]||||reg||1
